    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYNTHROME </strong> is designed with speedrunners in mind. It mixes early 2000s 3D platformer charm with modern gameplay &amp; game design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is all about speed, precision, and fluid movement. <br>Every jump, slide, and burst of speed must be carefully timed, turning each level into a test of skill and strategy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore levels packed with shortcuts, secrets, and rewards. No hand-holding\u2014just pure challenge. Prove your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYNTHROME </strong>level design is inspired by Sonic adventure, where the levels feel more like a playground, and the more you master the mechanics &amp; memorize the level, the more you can find new ways, faster times to beat the level, or search for secrets &amp; rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It follows the open-level design philosophy where the level is sort of linear but almost everything you see in the level is reachable and is part of the design (almost nothing is \u201cjust a background\u201d)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This offers a ton of replay value for the players &amp; new ways to speedrun the game, as we encourage players to \u201cbreak\u201d the levels &amp; the game (I mean, it\u2019s more fun isn\u2019t it?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and we also have a challenge mode (Check Extra content section) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>SYNTHROME </strong>was once ruled by The Builders, who built the SynthRide for times of war &amp; instability, which you the player will control, in a fight against the Seven SYNs who took over the world of <strong>SYNTHROME</strong>, guided by mysterious cues &amp; logs, you find yourself sometimes lost, but you have one mission &amp; one mission only, which is liberate <strong>SYNTHROME </strong>from the SYNs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start off logging in the \u201cserver\u201d which is uncorrupted. Then move on to the hub, which is chaotic, you\u2019ll go through a long journey through vast lands &amp; different environments all the way to SYN City all spread out across 18+ full levels. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308280/extras/8424118b6d606e0239334366aa8a0b15.poster.avif?t=1753308526\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308280/extras/8424118b6d606e0239334366aa8a0b15.webm?t=1753308526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308280/extras/8424118b6d606e0239334366aa8a0b15.mp4?t=1753308526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extra Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge mode</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYNTHROME </strong>offers a challenge mode where you get different types of puzzles, platforming challenges, stealth, time-attack, over 15 different challenges for those of you that are hardcore gamers looking for a challenge.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and Rewards</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden areas and collectibles that reward exploration and mastery, enhancing the sense of accomplishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a game that demands mastery, celebrating the old-school challenge of repeated attempts and eventual victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308280/extras/357b9020fff6602d013158289c15ec50.poster.avif?t=1753308526\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308280/extras/357b9020fff6602d013158289c15ec50.webm?t=1753308526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308280/extras/357b9020fff6602d013158289c15ec50.mp4?t=1753308526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
