st, but you have one mission &amp; one mission only, which is liberate <strong>SYNTHROME </strong>from the SYNs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start off logging in the \u201cserver\u201d which is uncorrupted. Then move on to the hub, which is chaotic, you\u2019ll go through a long journey through vast lands &amp; different environments all the way to SYN City all spread out across 18+ full levels. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308280/extras/8424118b6d606e0239334366aa8a0b15.poster.avif?t=1753308526\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308280/extras/8424118b6d606e0239334366aa8a0b15.webm?t=1753308526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308280/extras/8424118b6d606e0239334366aa8a0b15.mp4?t=1753308526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extra Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge mode</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYNTHROME </strong>offers a challenge mode where you get different types of puzzles, platforming challenges, stealth, time-attack, over 15 different challenges for those of you that are hardcore gamers looking for a challenge.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and Rewards</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden areas and collectibles that reward exploration and mastery, enhancing the sense of accomplishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a game that demands mastery, celebrating the old-school challenge of repeated attempts and eventual victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308280/extras/357b9020fff6602d013158289c15ec50.poster.avif?t=1753308526\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308280/extras/357b9020fff6602d013158289c15ec50.webm?t=1753308526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308280/extras/357b9020fff6602d013158289c15ec50.mp4?t=1753308526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
